{"2234150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BACKROOMS: APPREHENSION", "steam_appid": 2234150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BACKROOMS: APPREHENSION is a terrifying and immersive multiplayer horror experience that blends action, stealth, horror, and social deduction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two vastly different play styles, high replayability thanks to player interactions, and a unique atmosphere of dread and paranoia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND ESCAPE AS A SCIENTIST</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234150/extras/9ae7085b739fd54979a4121cd5123c3b.poster.avif?t=1775244230\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234150/extras/9ae7085b739fd54979a4121cd5123c3b.webm?t=1775244230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234150/extras/9ae7085b739fd54979a4121cd5123c3b.mp4?t=1775244230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hostile shapeshifting monster is lurking among your team and won't stop until every last human has been eliminated! <br>You'll need to scavenge for supplies and weapons while trying to work with your team to expose the creature or find a way to escape. <br>Be extremely careful! Trusting the wrong person could be your last mistake...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANIPULATE AND TERRORIZE AS THE SKIN STEALER</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234150/extras/7160c32605c0bc70d65b1f5298aa6e84.poster.avif?t=1775244230\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234150/extras/7160c32605c0bc70d65b1f5298aa6e84.webm?t=1775244230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234150/extras/7160c32605c0bc70d65b1f5298aa6e84.mp4?t=1775244230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the monstrous shapeshifting Skin Stealer, your only goal is to eliminate or infect all humans before they expose you or escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct attacks won't work against a well-coordinated team; you’ll need to be cunning.<br>Assimilate your victims, hide in plain sight, sow distrust, spread paranoia, and pit them against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 12 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced and intense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BACKROOMS: APPREHENSION is a terrifying and immersive multiplayer horror experience that blends action, stealth, horror, and social deduction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two vastly different play styles, high replayability thanks to player interactions, and a unique atmosphere of dread and paranoia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND ESCAPE AS A SCIENTIST</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234150/extras/9ae7085b739fd54979a4121cd5123c3b.poster.avif?t=1775244230\" widt